   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="berlin"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP0407_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>ʾsp̄pʾṭˈ MN ẔK Y ʿL bwnˈ ẔNH
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>BYRḤ ddwˈ Y ŠNṬ $X-IIII ʾwcynkˈ
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>Y PWN glmyh Y hmplhwṭl ʾwsṭʾndʾl
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>lʾd nmkˈ whʾk ŠG G-I ʿL
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>pylwcˈ Y nywbyhkʾn YḤBWNṭˈ ckˈ plhwdʾn
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>ḤṬYMWNṭ
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP0407_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Aspbād az ān ī ō bun ēn
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>māh Day ī sal 34 uzēnag
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>ī pad garmīh ī ham-farroxtar ōstāndār
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>rāy namak wahāg ǰaw grīw-ēw ō
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>Pērōz ī Nēwbēhagān dād čak Farroxyān
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>āwišt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP0407_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Aspbād from that which (belongs) to the bun this
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>month Day (10th month) of year 34: because of the expenses
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>of the *bath of the equally very fortunate Ōstāndār,
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>gave salt worth 1 grīw of barley to
               <lb n="5-6" xml:id="trans-p1-l5-6"/>Pērōz ī Nēwbēhagān. Farroxyān sealed the čak.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>